{"revision":"70a10bc257c0afdb74cb08ee1fc732e63ddc16da1f08c6f205cedff031bd04f9","generatedAt":"2026-08-27T20:00:02.961Z","app":{"id":"org.gnome.Calculator","name":"Calculator","summary":"Perform arithmetic, scientific or financial calculations","description":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Calculator is an application that solves mathematical equations. Though it at first appears to be a simple calculator with only basic arithmetic operations, you can switch into Advanced, Financial, or Programming mode to find a surprising set of capabilities."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"The Advanced calculator supports many operations, including: logarithms, factorials, trigonometric and hyperbolic functions, modulus division, complex numbers, random number generation and prime factorization."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Financial mode supports several computations, including periodic interest rate, present and future value, double declining and straight line depreciation, and many others."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Programming mode supports calculations using common bases (binary, octal, decimal, and hexadecimal), bitwise operations, two’s complement, character to character code conversion, and more."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Conversion mode supports conversions between common units, currencies and number bases."}]}],"projectLicense":"GPL-3.0-or-later","developer":{"name":"The GNOME Project"},"homepage":"https://apps.gnome.org/Calculator","repository":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-calculator","links":{"bugtracker":"https://gitlab.gnome.org/GNOME/gnome-calculator/issues","help":"https://help.gnome.org/users/gnome-calculator/stable/","donation":"https://www.gnome.org/donate/","translate":"https://l10n.gnome.org/module/gnome-calculator/"},"contentRating":{"label":"Early Childhood","minimumAge":3},"keywords":["arithmetic","scientific","financial"],"categories":["Utility","Calculator"],"translations":{"nl":{"name":"Rekenmachine","summary":"Voer rekenkundige, wetenschappelijke of financiële berekeningen uit","description":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Rekenmachine is een toepassing die wiskundige vergelijkingen oplost. Alhoewel het op het eerste gezicht een eenvoudige rekenmachine lijkt met slechts rekenkundige basisoperaties, kunt u omschakelen naar de modi Geavanceerd, Financieel of Programmeren en een verbazende verzameling mogelijkheden vinden."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"De geavanceerde rekenmachine ondersteunt vele operaties, waaronder: logaritmes, ontbinden in factoren, goniometrische en hyperbolische functies, modulair delen, complexe getallen, genereren van willekeurige getallen en ontbinden in priemfactoren."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Financiële modus ondersteunt diverse berekeningen waaronder periodieke rente, huidige en toekomstige waarde, dubbel afnemende- en lineaire afschrijving en vele andere."}]},{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","value":"Conversiemodus ondersteunt conversies tussen veelvoorkomende eenheden, munteenheden en grondtallen."}]}],"keywords":["calculation","arithmetic","scientific"],"contentRating":{"label":"3"}}},"addedAt":"2026-08-22","origin":{"type":"third-party"},"icon":{"source":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Calculator/d16bfbadda92316e8d9e31c97f951dc9/icons/128x128/org.gnome.Calculator.png","url":"/apphub/_astro/3d22aac2ba369ea1629ae399337652db6b41014675697c5b94b46d90afe79143.eYW0QBuj.webp","type":"image/webp"},"sandbox":{"network":"client","display":"wayland-and-x11","audio":"none","processes":"isolated","ipc":false,"filesystem":[],"devices":["gpu"],"portals":["settings"],"sessionBus":[],"systemBus":[]},"slug":"calculator","screenshots":[{"source":"https://dl.flathub.org/media/org/gnome/Calculator/d16bfbadda92316e8d9e31c97f951dc9/screenshots/image-1